From 0e5e6e972d5790c48bec74723ebee396525a51c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FP mod <fpmod@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 20:52:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/30] Domain camera views: smooth turning option (F1, on by
 default)

The camera yaw and the beetle's drawn rotation ease round when turning in the
3D views; the game's own heading and turn timing are untouched. Off restores
the original snap. Setting smooth_turns.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
